# vis3d model: ARM-6, the six-axis cell of the robot branch: the arm
# (arm6_arm.vis) with a two-finger gripper and a demo cell. The chain, joint
# limits and the arm's collision capsules come from arm_sim's model (the
# same DH as armkins / genserkins), so the view and the kinematics can't
# disagree; these files only dress it up.
include arm6_arm.vis

# the tool point: the gripper's fingertips, in the flange frame
tcp 0 0 0.13

# a two-finger gripper on the flange
part 6 box 0.09 0.05 0.05 at 0 0 0.03 material dark
part 6 box 0.014 0.03 0.08 at 0.025 0 0.09 material grip
part 6 box 0.014 0.03 0.08 at -0.025 0 0.09 material grip

# the cell (base frame, m), as geom.h obstacles: the guard sees the same
obstacle conveyor box 1.05 -0.15 0.38 0.22 0.70 0.38
obstacle pallet box -0.15 0.95 0.08 0.40 0.30 0.08
obstacle post capsule -0.85 -0.85 0 -0.85 -0.85 1.6 0.05
